      <h2>Common Reasons for Image Rejection on Join Indian Army Portal</h2>
      <ul class="rejection-list">
        <li><strong>Signatures in Capital / Block Letters:</strong> Writing your signature in uppercase letters or using initials causes immediate disqualification. Sign in natural continuous cursive script.</li>
        <li><strong>Signature File Under 5 KB or Over 20 KB:</strong> The joinindianarmy.nic.in portal strictly rejects signatures outside the 5–20 KB boundary. Our engine automatically pads JPEG comment bytes if clean signatures drop below 5 KB.</li>
        <li><strong>Colored or Shadowed Backgrounds:</strong> Backgrounds featuring household walls, outdoor scenery, or door frames are not accepted. Only plain white or light backgrounds pass validation.</li>
        <li><strong>Wearing Caps, Hats, or Dark Glasses:</strong> Headgear (except traditional Sikh turbans) and tinted glasses are strictly forbidden. Eyes, ears, and full face must be clearly visible.</li>
        <li><strong>Photo Not Matching Physical Appearance at Rally:</strong> Appearing at the recruitment rally ground with a drastically altered beard, mustache, or hairstyle compared to your application photograph leads to identity mismatch.</li>
      </ul>

